  <item>
    <title>009/一个艺术主理人，第一份工作干了7年？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d3cceee924d4525a908324</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d3cceee924d4525a908324</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Mar 2025 06:38:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期我们邀请到了AVG艺术空间主理人上官凯莉，一起聊聊艺术以及她的世界（关于第一份工作就干七年，我们都很敬佩这位伟大的女性。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>感谢本期嘉宾：上官凯莉 ✿</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> </span><strong><span>上官凯莉带着AVG空间来啦</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 什么是非盈利空间</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 艺术家可以飘，但艺术从业者不可以</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> 艺术主理人的一天是什么样的？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> 人与空间都要开放，连接，成长</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> 作为个体：温柔，细腻抑或是自信</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> 国画为什么不能很当代呢？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> 我们爱的女性艺术家们</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3436">57:16</a> 我与艺术相拥，但也要学会分开</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3436">57:16</a> &nbsp;- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4024">1:07:04</a> 艺术只是开始，用做什么才是关键</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4024">1:07:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4393">1:13:13</a> 创造力能松绑你与工作的关系</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4393">1:13:13</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4711">1:18:31</a> 如何实现长期有效的工作关系</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4711">1:18:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4984">1:23:04</a> 你的美好生活是什么样的？</span></h2><span></span><p><span>BGM：春天 - 姜昕</span></p><span></span><p><span>公告：</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年3月8日—31日 凯莉的AVG空间正在进行艺术家何绮的驻地个展“我的美好生活”</span></p><span></span><p><span>在成都的朋友有空可以去看看，也可以关注AVG空间的播客“AVG Talk”</span></p><span></span><p><span>看展提前预约哟（链接预约）</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2LNeNmIBN-IXkn1j_SIDYw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2LNeNmIBN-IXkn1j_SIDYw"><span>AVG空间</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>飞行嘉宾介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>上官凯莉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策展人、艺术家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国 AVG 空间（Aspiring Van Gogh）艺术总监 ；</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵高艺工厂国际驻留项目负责人 ；</span></p><span></span><p><span>长期开展伦敦梵高故居（Van Gogh House London）</span></p><span></span><p><span>和伦敦三妹画廊（San Mei Gallery）与中国的艺术文化交流合作 ；</span></p><span></span><p><span>四川大学“艺术 × 设计 × 心理”跨学科实验艺术项目核心成员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她的策展风格以实验性的个案研究为主，关注当代青年艺术家发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主要践⾏艺术驻留项⽬，注重展览的学术性和前沿性，</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过跨学科方式研究当代社会人与人、人与自然、人与科技的关系。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/655f455a7bf44ad6ea6461b6/liSyk9W5SMtpqyh6mfpv5IxA5S52.m4a" length="81259126" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008/当建筑转行成为产业链，我们和现建筑师、前建筑师聊了聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b3479005a90dfd0d15822f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b3479005a90dfd0d15822f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 14:37:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们邀请了三个建筑学教育背景的朋友，但正处在不同职业状态中的建筑人一起聊聊建筑转行的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢本期嘉宾 秋实、桃桃、子轩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a>名校建筑生的逐梦建筑界：看不到夕阳的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 从名校毕业的建筑师转到建筑Pr</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a>:想要转行的那一刻，只是因为见不到的“太阳”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 转行？还是在本专业门外兜兜转转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 建筑学教育是全能型教育吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2323">38:43</a>建筑师转行建筑pr，感受到的轻视是来自建筑师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a> 转行，是信息茧房还是情绪茧房？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 从乙方到甲方的困境，专业技能与科层制管理的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 保持灵活，转行不是非黑即白的零和博弈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3271">54:31</a> &nbsp;折腾不可怕，可怕的是失去折腾的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3508">58:28</a> &nbsp;我们是如何定义转行成功的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3666">1:01:06</a> 到底怎么样才算“上岸”？“上岸了”然后呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4268">1:11:08</a> 专业与专业大不同，“不务正业”的专业也就不存在转行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4741">1:19:01</a> 转行，职场人的中场休息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4809">1:20:09</a> 工作本质再定义，保持创作，抵抗异化</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头：Gang Gang Schiele-hyukoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：平淡日子里的刺 -宋冬野</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：Everything-Monta</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/655f455a7bf44ad6ea6461b6/lq4cnFeqR378sOS3gXg43JQ7hh3D.m4a" length="86459322" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007/2024年度9问:与结构松绑，和生活开放关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67736c5f1e823e72d319fdd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67736c5f1e823e72d319fdd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 04:21:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年过去了，我们借用9个简单的问题，以声音总结了我们过去的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你又会如何回答过去这一年呢？👏欢迎在评论区和我们评论交流</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.S：这也是我们第一次尝试以线上远程的方式完成了这一期的录制，声音质量也不可避免收到了一些折损，还请见谅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1.时间过的快吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>2.开心吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>3.最悲伤的事是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>4.还想做艺术吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2449">40:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>5.今年有什么样的收获和改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">48:57</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>6.今天最大三类消费支出是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3467">57:47</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>7.今年花得最值一笔钱是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4106">1:08:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>8.喜欢当下的自己吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4156">1:09:16</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>9.明年期待什么样的改变？还想学什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵万能青年旅店-《不万能的喜剧》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵NewJeans-《ditto》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkJttBiOe0YbGKnb4Sa9gmuWvou1.m4a" length="76668996" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
