  <item>
    <title>006/《好东西》：女人写的新东西！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6745f4ba8d1233fb0d4bc09e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6745f4ba8d1233fb0d4bc09e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Nov 2024 20:50:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 三个女人一台戏：一起来看《好东西》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 看完后最直观的感受，又日常又被爽到了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 对于三个女人印象最深的一幕，绝不是“爱我便是”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 那些年，我们和前夫哥、小马、赵医生（ 社科男，虎扑男，文艺男等）的一些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 《我的天才女友》VS 《好东西》 尼诺是新型女性的陷阱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 自我意识中的男性与女性。权力关系还是情感联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3344">55:44</a> 《好东西》中展现的那些女性长期存在，却不被言说的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3563">59:23</a> 《好东西》背景人设大猜想：小叶的妈、前夫哥的家庭到底是啥样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">72:55</a> Kerry暴论：男性比女性更需要一段亲密关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4810">80:10</a> 为什么电影要取名《好东西》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">82:20</a> 《爱情神话》VS《好东西》 ，只能在上海发生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5523">92:03</a> 悟了！虎扑女神高圆圆要和赵又廷结婚，是有原因的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：《蜜湖》-简约情人</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《醒》-空了吹乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>联想片单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的天才女友》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《玩偶之家》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《爱情神话》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>补充物料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/6226022546/5102752118866833?wm=3333_2001&amp;from=10EB193010&amp;sourcetype=weixin&amp;s_trans=1729196505_5102752118866833&amp;s_channel=4" data-url="https://weibo.com/6226022546/5102752118866833?wm=3333_2001&amp;from=10EB193010&amp;sourcetype=weixin&amp;s_trans=1729196505_5102752118866833&amp;s_channel=4"><span>邵导脱口秀solo视频</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh5fLheqggVwwi4-QI31n906NlSt.m4a" length="94854393" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>005/「去班味」的夏天：3个人，5条路线，九月疯狂出游大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67290f3933c798676f732a8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67290f3933c798676f732a8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 19:27:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Show notes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 本期开场白：关系户：好玩艺产品经理yudo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 三人的冲动钱（旅行版）和旅行路线</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>重庆 |山西（晋东南） | 景德镇 |大阪 | 香港</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">1:01:13</a> ninjia 和好友高温天暴走重庆小众地下景区</span></p><span></span><p><span>涪陵：</span></p><span></span><p><span>古代水文站的重生：白鹤梁水下博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>“三体”红岸基地现实版 「816核工程」</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以睡大觉的罗汉寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">1:01:13</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6355">1:45:55</a> 鸭鸭再回山西和江西：</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑神话热度下的晋东南古建特种兵（附i人访古开门指南）</span></p><span></span><p><span>三次景德镇游背后的变化与发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6355">1:45:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7380">2:03:00</a> Kerry独身闯日，大阪旅行变成关于工作的深刻思考？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7380">2:03:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8267">2:17:47</a> 鸭鸭和伴侣穿洞洞鞋暴走香港，看展逛书店逛到脚疼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8267">2:17:47</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8533">2:22:13</a> 为什么我们还是如此迷恋旅行？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnGKkLBKRqN4TMe6VeobwocN578J.m4a" length="138382792" type="audio/mp4"/>
