  <item>
    <title>004/过一种「低能耗」的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b23d07e0957daebd5c3dd0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b23d07e0957daebd5c3dd0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Aug 2024 15:11:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">0:25</a> 某位特邀迷人男性口播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">0:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 7月大型冲动钱现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4742">1:19:02</a> enter的低能耗生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论里留言和我们分享你的「低能耗」时刻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提及的书：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36801839/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36801839/?dt_dapp=1"><span>《不必向长安——沈周的记忆抽帧术》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36480776/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36480776/?dt_dapp=1"><span>《隔江山色 元代绘画1279-1368》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36148591/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36148591/"><span>韩炳哲《 山寨：中国式解构》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>音频节目 &nbsp;：《三联·文明寻踪》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提及的产品：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>优衣库神裤货号：471631</span></p><span></span><p><span>迪卡侬小包: Quechua NH120</span></p><span></span><p><span>迪卡侬墨镜：Rockrider SG50 181291</span></p><span></span><p><span>p.s:对不起manner,无辜中枪，我们说的是M stand</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Sorry about your wall》：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrp6t42hUqyvuoZQK4-0t9DfFzvi.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
