  <item>
    <title>003/5月「冲动钱」：辛苦赚钱的我们，花的每一笔钱都很make sense</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6664524e63c334a2fb3b01ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6664524e63c334a2fb3b01ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Jun 2024 12:45:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「冲动钱」</span></strong><span>是enter开辟的月度新栏目，集合三人每月冲动消费的瞬间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个栏目中，我们将分享在那些生活所需之外发生的冲动、临时、意外的消费内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过分享我们的「冲动钱」内容以及背后发生动机，展现出我们作为个体如何以消费作为一种方式，冲走日常的固定沉闷，冲开附近的光怪陆离。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>花钱行业垂直选手nijia</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁不喜欢猫meme啊！200个素材，3块9，无限的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁喜欢真猫猫啊！爱做家务的猫猫让我花了450元通厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书爆红的玄学app——测测，9.9元买了个恋爱脑</span></p><span></span><p><span>是真的冲动钱，299优衣库防晒衣买成男装</span></p><span></span><p><span>18元喝冰美式，马思唯经常出没的咖啡店</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的天蝎妈妈，豆腐心花了1500元</span></p><span></span><p><span>yaya</span></p><span></span><p><span>干一行买一行，200元买到书法老师找我要链接~</span></p><span></span><p><span>不是我的错吧？19元买微信阅读包月会员，但买了只会看3天</span></p><span></span><p><span>住在成都玉林的人类学毕业生，尝试用美食寻找附近</span></p><span></span><p><span>kerry：</span></p><span></span><p><span>花50元在成都看《上海笑话》，发现自己也是joker……</span></p><span></span><p><span>花18.9元打假！是谁说“我有根，但我流动”出自艾德琳·弗吉尼亚·伍尔芙《海浪》的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>塔罗让我认命，那就花299元买圣杯女王必备红裙！</span></p><span></span><p><span>太久不骑摩托车电瓶没电了，买了个摩托车充电器30元</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp0WKrFlXDdfU0kn2FaYRLRr8lF0.m4a" length="36324873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>“架势”摆龙门阵 |成都文娱爱好者的钱都去哪了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663e00ceaf6f88d32f9e559a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663e00ceaf6f88d32f9e559a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 11:11:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>友台</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a9484fc1a771dfd679a33c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64a9484fc1a771dfd679a33c"><span>《架势说JUST TALK》</span></a><span>的两位主播来了！</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a></span></strong></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span>5个成都文娱爱好者的钱都去哪了？</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> yaya：山西看古建，和小孩哥一起学书法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> kerry：学游泳修脑子，春游音乐节，读语言学的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> peter：看电影、看展、买文创；ninjia：买了富士xh2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> fanfan：强推《年少日记》</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 已婚男女和未婚姐妹聊聊《坠落的审判》</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>《坠落的审判》故事大纲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> -<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> peter：作为一个成都已婚男，我没觉得这是一个女权主义电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 婚姻当中有权力关系吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">34:43</a> 两个足够独立的个体结合才能创造一段好的关系吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 新型家庭关系在中国水土不服了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3037">50:37</a> 多语种：日常交流的缓冲地带。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3037">50:37</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 电影中杀伤力最大的一句话是：“I love u”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>展讯信息：陈古个展：希望陆地</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TvzC2WoEEjxas80S2aqMmA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TvzC2WoEEjxas80S2aqMmA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gordon Webster《I’d like to teach the world to sing》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dolly Parton《Jolene》</span></p><span></span><p><span>诺米么lodmemo《谢天谢帝》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljZxmg8gQhfbfSfOh8KDMmi8v9S2.m4a" length="51142671" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
