  <item>
    <title>002/“原来不是我的问题”：从赛博八字到灵性觉醒，我们为何开始热衷玄学讨论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66140f1048c40e2fb00b5d68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66140f1048c40e2fb00b5d68</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Apr 2024 15:36:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们半信半疑地说着玄学，但更关注的是我们在当下如何向内探寻自己，去正视自己的情绪以及身体上的反应。面对动荡不安的当下，尝试从自我出发，以自我为经验，是我们的行动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>相信在是非之外，有一座花园，我们会在那里相遇。</span></p><span></span><p><span>__</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏🏻</span><strong><span>本期特邀嘉宾：廖老师</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>艺术打工人&amp;空了吹乐队主唱</span></p><span></span><p><span>“文物修复转到当代艺术，发现音乐才是我的爱”</span></p><span></span><p><span>__</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵开头BGM：Desert Flags 沙漠之帜</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵结尾BGM：一命，二运，三风水 /Swing</span></p><span></span><p><span>__</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>四个人的赛博八字</span></p><span></span><p><span>三个i人，一个e人</span></p><span></span><p><span>2个天秤 1个双子1个处女</span></p><span></span><p><span>入职第一天，一句回答发现我俩同一星座！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>空间与我们的感知影响：国家，城市以及一个属于自己的单人间（一个人的世界）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>产幻：小时候，我看过一米长的蚂蚁！</span></p><span></span><p><span>想发财的注意听：24年九紫离火，我们应该如何开buff？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>学会放过自己一马</span></p><span></span><p><span>个人灵性、身体性的发展以及跟随直觉性的唤起：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">1:07:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>用啤酒盖也能占卜？120岁时还能生孩子？</span></p><span></span><p><span>占卜，是对事物发展的一套解释系统&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">1:17:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>渺小的我，盔甲上的裂缝，我看见了时代中的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4980">1:23:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>玄学背后还有怎么样的社会结构：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《沙丘》是过去的未来，</span></p><span></span><p><span>社会中，女性是过去，未来还有此刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">1:35:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大时代下，从自我出发，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你相信明天会更好？！？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqfR5yNIniQRqtaYmYay0g_WG2O6.m4a" length="100060284" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:42:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0nrtf3WPQAa-F0NZ9Oh7rl2FzC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>001 /从马德里到成都，2023年我们的超主观看展大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6595665b096f477b3ebd93b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6595665b096f477b3ebd93b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 13:51:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听Enter，这是一档关于文化消费类漫谈播客。我们都是独立又渺小的樱桃。三位常驻主播，ninjia, yaya, kerry 坐标成都，看心情边吃边聊。绝对有偏见地讨论城市、艺术、设计、生活方式相关话题。如果你也恰好对以上内容感兴趣，欢迎真诚探讨，也支持来信反驳。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023年过去了，3个人以展览为线索，聊聊我们今年在成都、马德里、上海、泉州、山西等地的观看体验，惊喜、爆哭、顿悟又或者吐槽，皆是因为热爱。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>SHOWNOTES</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;年终展览top3</span></p><span></span><p><span>ninjia:</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>索菲亚皇家艺术中心博物馆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.museoreinasofia.es/en/collection" data-url="https://www.museoreinasofia.es/en/collection"><span>www.museoreinasofia.es</span></a></p><span></span><h1><span>黎朗、李俊双个展：延展与隐匿——俊朗之径</span></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hvk51XNG3l-6oLqUsEzMvw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hvk51XNG3l-6oLqUsEzMvw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第十四届上海双年展“宇宙电影”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.powerstationofart.com/whats-on/programs/shanghai-biennale/home" data-url="https://www.powerstationofart.com/whats-on/programs/shanghai-biennale/home"><span>www.powerstationofart.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>yaya：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>CACP OPEN DAY（草稿版）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QZhST3zvatvb5R5ICYBz3g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QZhST3zvatvb5R5ICYBz3g"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Kerry:</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《灵韵之光：大卷伸嗣个展》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4by3OCWTidrFZI6hXDptTw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4by3OCWTidrFZI6hXDptTw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第十四届上海双年展“宇宙电影”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JC4xFG3bHrTmpgdsh_zXAg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JC4xFG3bHrTmpgdsh_zXAg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>鹿野苑石刻博物馆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.archiposition.com/items/7216bbf3bd" data-url="https://www.archiposition.com/items/7216bbf3bd"><span>www.archiposition.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a>什么是我们心目中的好展览？策展是信息编辑与整合</span></p><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><strong><span>《市民都会——上海：现代城市主义的样本》，2016，上海 PSA</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/V1abd2nfq4owP9NLhC6ZBQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/V1abd2nfq4owP9NLhC6ZBQ"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>《安迪·沃霍尔：影子》，2016，余德耀美术馆</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qtYKMWJD8j_J2NsV1Lv8hQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qtYKMWJD8j_J2NsV1Lv8hQ"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 艺术书展究竟是做“展”还是做“市集”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>奇点艺术节：奇点计划®️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://singularityplan.com/" data-url="https://singularityplan.com/"><span>singularityplan.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a>，新旧成都人看成都双年展，我们有更了解成都了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个侧面的参考与视角： &nbsp;&nbsp;意大利独立策展人在中国： Marco Scotini</span></p><span></span><p><span>Marco Scotini首届安仁双年展今日之往昔 国际板块策展人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《四川故事 —— 戏剧与历史》， 2017，安仁</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.artlinkart.com/cn/exhibition/overview/189ewxnn/geographically/rest_of_china/2017" data-url="http://www.artlinkart.com/cn/exhibition/overview/189ewxnn/geographically/rest_of_china/2017"><span>www.artlinkart.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aYiQ0TcooZv2uG2xsKfs4A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aYiQ0TcooZv2uG2xsKfs4A"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第二届银川双年展总策展人， 2018，银川</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.moca-yinchuan.com/biennale/detail/?id=11" data-url="http://www.moca-yinchuan.com/biennale/detail/?id=11"><span>www.moca-yinchuan.com</span></a></p><span></span><h1><span>地缘策展——卢迎华对话马可·斯科蒂尼</span></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UA4aWLxfKnR54KMFzQD8Dw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UA4aWLxfKnR54KMFzQD8Dw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> &nbsp;简明的无尽之旋 ：盛大的展览和我们并不理解的表达</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《无尽之旋 II—— James Jean简明》，2023，成都</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/thuElW7E6UjBmRG_KgRA5A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/thuElW7E6UjBmRG_KgRA5A"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a>麓山美术馆 何工个展 ：对空间的运用十分精彩，让场地成为叙述的一部分</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《地图——何工个展》，2022，成都</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JNWWWQS2tqEPyijkuPntmA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JNWWWQS2tqEPyijkuPntmA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2756">45:56</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;综合装置与展陈设计的交锋</span></p><span></span><p><span>索菲亚皇家艺术中心 Hito Steyerl’s “Adorno’s Grey”（阿多诺的灰色）索菲亚皇家艺术中心 馆藏第八章节 “出埃及记”，艺术史遗漏的叙事。</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>《“不可思议的行动”群展》</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span>对比A4不可思议的行动，社会参与式艺术，疑问：什么是参与，如何参与。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NMpuyKAEd7KwlVNOZwud9A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NMpuyKAEd7KwlVNOZwud9A"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a> 我们的遗憾：做艺术的和看艺术的，视角各不相同</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>陈盈如：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.yinjuchen.com/video.html" data-url="http://www.yinjuchen.com/video.html"><span>www.yinjuchen.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3549">59:09</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3794">01:03:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;展览的 “大”是力度还是无奈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3794">01:03:14</a> -<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">01:05:05</a> 失去一次认识大卫霍克尼的机会</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大卫霍克尼bigger and closer</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.kingscross.co.uk/event/hockney-bigger-and-closer" data-url="https://www.kingscross.co.uk/event/hockney-bigger-and-closer"><span>www.kingscross.co.uk</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gAy-PzuQtuAoHTsxk5UKIQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gAy-PzuQtuAoHTsxk5UKIQ"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 我们的内部观察：落日书展·成都站、《白蚁：如法炮制》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《白蚁：如法炮制》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wx83sNLYsE2rkrrJdKkMhg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wx83sNLYsE2rkrrJdKkMhg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">01:30:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6540">01:49:00</a> 回到最初，为什么我们要看展？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5452">01:30:52</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6537">01:48:57</a> yaya额外掉落的山西古建之旅感悟：用亲身体验替换二手经验</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuV1E0RBIYxCttBGlkPoJduKwFdp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>△从永安禅寺离开后回望夕阳下的浑源县城</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoU7dyppaeTVKsr446a5bngWfRMM.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>△阴雨中的永乐宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6538">01:48:58</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6601">01:50:01</a>打个总结，一直在场，许愿2024</span></p>]]></description>
